\item OpenAI, \emph{Universal Computation with Eventually Stationary Navier–Stokes Forcing}, 2026-09-27; citation key \texttt{OAI:Universal-Computation-with-Eventually-Stationary-Navier-Stokes-Forcing-September-27-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-Computation-with-Eventually-Stationary-Navier-Stokes-Forcing-September-27-2026/manuscript.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-Computation-with-Eventually-Stationary-Navier-Stokes-Forcing-September-27-2026/manuscript.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-Computation-with-Eventually-Stationary-Navier-Stokes-Forcing-September-27-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Universal-Computation-with-Eventually-Stationary-Navier-Stokes-Forcing-September-27-2026/manuscript.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Universal-Computation-with-Eventually-Stationary-Navier-Stokes-Forcing-September-27-2026/build/main.tex\#L146}{thm:main}.
\item Family 376: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/376.md}{Lean scope}.
